{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mana_wraith","model_identifier":"mana_wraith","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mana_wraith\n\nMana wraith (C5, Deadlands), floating, 2.2 m = 78 u to the hood peak. Hovers: the fading tail ends about 4 u above y = 0.\n\nA floating, ragged hooded figure whose body fades from deep violet to nothing: a tall hood over a black void face with two cyan eye-points, a mantle and long sleeves fraying away, pale violet claws, and robes in three tiers (robe_1 > robe_2 > robe_3) dithered through transparent texture pixels until they vanish. A bright cyan crystal shard (`crystal` bone, glow_crystal*) floats and turns in a hollow in its chest; it is the mana crystal it drops. Baseline humanoid upper-body skeleton and slot names (leg bones present but empty).\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -12.0..12.0, y 4.0..80.0, z -5.5..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 74 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 4\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `float` | 1.5 | loop | gliding, leaning into the move, tatters trailing (loop) |\n| `cast_bolt` | 1.3 | once | crystal flares 0.5 s, key 0.75 s: the bolt leaves fx_hand_r toward the target |\n| `phase` | 1 | once | blink: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.55 s: move it then), unfolds back; scale keys on root |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | rises, arms spread, crystal spinning |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | recoil |\n| `death` | 1.8 | hold | convulses, unravels and shrinks to nothing (root scale) while the crystal grows back to full size and comes to rest lying on the ground (y = 0) at 1.4 s; holds. Spawn the mana crystal drop there / swap it in |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `float`: 71.1 u/s (2.0 m/s) gliding; its only move (replaces walk and run)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_bolt`: crystal flares 0.5 s, key 0.75 s: the bolt leaves fx_hand_r toward the target\n- `phase`: blink: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.55 s: move it then), unfolds back; scale keys on root\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 75, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59.5, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53.5, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 35, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 35, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6.5, 43, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6.5, 43, 2.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 30, -0.5)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 30, -0.5)\n- `fx_crystal` on `crystal` at (0, 54, -2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crystal*.\n- The texture uses fully transparent pixels (alpha 0) for the fade; render with alpha test / cutout.\n- Uses `scale` keys on root (phase, death) and crystal (cast_bolt, death).\n- `fx_crystal`: the shard centre; `fx_hand_r` / `fx_hand_l`: claw tips.\n- Variant texture: mana_wraith_pale.png (paler violet, green-cyan shard).\n"},"description":"# mana_wraith\n\nMana wraith (C5, Deadlands), floating, 2.2 m = 78 u to the hood peak. Hovers: the fading tail ends about 4 u above y = 0.\n\nA floating, ragged hooded figure whose body fades from deep violet to nothing: a tall hood over a black void face with two cyan eye-points, a mantle and long sleeves fraying away, pale violet claws, and robes in three tiers (robe_1 > robe_2 > robe_3) dithered through transparent texture pixels until they vanish. A bright cyan crystal shard (`crystal` bone, glow_crystal*) floats and turns in a hollow in its chest; it is the mana crystal it drops. Baseline humanoid upper-body skeleton and slot names (leg bones present but empty).\n\n- Cubes: 28 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -12.0..12.0, y 4.0..80.0, z -5.5..5.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 20 x 74 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 4\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop |  |\n| `float` | 1.5 | loop | gliding, leaning into the move, tatters trailing (loop) |\n| `cast_bolt` | 1.3 | once | crystal flares 0.5 s, key 0.75 s: the bolt leaves fx_hand_r toward the target |\n| `phase` | 1 | once | blink: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.55 s: move it then), unfolds back; scale keys on root |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | rises, arms spread, crystal spinning |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | recoil |\n| `death` | 1.8 | hold | convulses, unravels and shrinks to nothing (root scale) while the crystal grows back to full size and comes to rest lying on the ground (y = 0) at 1.4 s; holds. Spawn the mana crystal drop there / swap it in |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `float`: 71.1 u/s (2.0 m/s) gliding; its only move (replaces walk and run)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_bolt`: crystal flares 0.5 s, key 0.75 s: the bolt leaves fx_hand_r toward the target\n- `phase`: blink: shrinks to nothing (gone 0.35-0.55 s: move it then), unfolds back; scale keys on root\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 75, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 55.5, 5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 59.5, 5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 53.5, -5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 35, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-12, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 35, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6.5, 43, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6.5, 43, 2.5)\n- `fx_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (9, 30, -0.5)\n- `fx_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-9, 30, -0.5)\n- `fx_crystal` on `crystal` at (0, 54, -2)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crystal*.\n- The texture uses fully transparent pixels (alpha 0) for the fade; render with alpha test / cutout.\n- Uses `scale` keys on root (phase, death) and crystal (cast_bolt, death).\n- `fx_crystal`: the shard centre; `fx_hand_r` / `fx_hand_l`: claw tips.\n- Variant texture: mana_wraith_pale.png (paler violet, green-cyan shard).\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,40.0,-3.0],"to":[5.5,46.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,40.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[36,50,47.0,56.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[100,50,106.0,56.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[47,50,58.0,56.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[106,50,112.0,56.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[58,50,69.0,56.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[69,50,80.0,56.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f4a57be9-1731-50f3-a84a-2903abc18fa2"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-6.5,46.0,-3.5],"to":[6.5,64.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,46.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,13.0,18.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[26,0,33.0,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[13,0,26.0,18.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[33,0,40.0,18.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[89,41,102.0,48.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[102,41,115.0,48.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4e22c746-0c0a-50d2-b151-56d2fed9c36c"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,64.0,-1.5],"to":[1.5,66.0,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,64.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[71,62,74.0,64.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[74,62,77.0,64.0],"t